# Appendable class infrastructure: AppendableSeq instance declares append-one = concat.
# Verifies the Appendable class and Seq instance are accessible and the concat operation works.
# Uses range to create Seqs without builtin-variant (which is not in the type env).
[result: [collect [concat [range 1 3] [range 3 5]]]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Dict({0: Int(1), 1: Int(2), 2: Int(3), 3: Int(4)})})
